      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Treasure Hunter's Shop",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Never mind",
      "translation" : "算了"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Treasure Hunter's Shop",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Ash]\nWell you see here you can exchange your treasure hunter tokens for zeny or rare weapons forged by our blacksmiths.\n \nEverything has its own price value and the only way you can get the tokens is by completing quests assigned to you,the system normally works like this.\n \nThe harder the mission the more Tokens you will earn. All red quests are worth 4-8 Tokens, and the rest are worth 1-5.\n \nHope that solves your problem and questions.",
      "translation" : "[阿什]\n在這裡，你可以用尋寶代幣兌換 Zeny，或是我們鐵匠打造的稀有武器。\n\n每件商品都有對應的價格，而獲取代幣的唯一途徑，就是完成分配給你的任務。\n\n任務越難，獲得的代幣越多。\n紅色任務獎勵 4 至 8 枚代幣，其他任務獎勵 1 至 5 枚。\n\n希望這樣能解答你的疑問。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Treasure Hunter's Shop",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Ash]\nOk here is our Big list of goods.\n \n(Note T stands for a Treasure Token.)",
      "translation" : "[阿什]\n好，這是我們的商品清單。\n\n（T 代表一枚尋寶代幣。）"
    },
